@@ -8248,6 +8254,20 @@ CPU[EAX=1]:ECX[24] (TSC_DEADLINE) is not reported by ``KVM_GET_SUPPORTED_CPUID``
 It can be enabled if ``KVM_CAP_TSC_DEADLINE_TIMER`` is present and the kernel
